# NOTE: infiniti uses this file for sys.oplus.ifaa.model. On lafa that property
# is not set by the stock odm (only vendor.oplus.ifaa.need_init=1 is present), so
# it is intentionally left out here rather than copied over.
#
# Add lafa-specific system_ext properties to this file as they are identified.
